IRGC: Reopening Hormuz is Iran’s decision alone, unrelated to the Oman talks. It happens only when the US fully accepts Iran’s conditions. 

Iran Foreign Ministry: The Oman deal is close but does not reopen the strait. Full reopening depends on the US honoring the June memorandum. ‘Iran is talking to Oman, not to US.’ 
